1
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:30,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Silent Storm]</font>

2
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:36,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong,</font>

3
00:01:37,590 --> 00:01:38,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">these are all external accounts.</font>

4
00:01:39,120 --> 00:01:39,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What about the internal accounts?</font>

5
00:01:41,040 --> 00:01:43,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did Third Granduncle send you
to take over Dongle?</font>

6
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:45,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

7
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:46,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came to broaden my horizons.</font>

8
00:01:47,040 --> 00:01:48,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There are so many bars nationwide,</font>

9
00:01:48,790 --> 00:01:50,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and so much alcohol every day,</font>

10
00:01:50,710 --> 00:01:52,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">all shipped out from Dongle.</font>

11
00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:53,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came to learn.</font>

12
00:01:54,480 --> 00:01:55,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems Third Granduncle</font>

13
00:01:56,950 --> 00:01:58,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is not satisfied with me.</font>

14
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:03,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your invoice laundering business.</font>

15
00:02:04,510 --> 00:02:05,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The laundered invoices</font>

16
00:02:06,230 --> 00:02:07,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">turn gray goods into licensed goods.</font>

17
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:09,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Profits multiplied several times over.</font>

18
00:02:09,710 --> 00:02:10,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Third Granduncle thinks</font>

19
00:02:12,470 --> 00:02:13,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">his men work themselves to the bone</font>

20
00:02:13,870 --> 00:02:15,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and only earn that little bit.</font>

21
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:18,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong, can you bring us in on it?</font>

22
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:20,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if I don't agree?</font>

23
00:02:25,870 --> 00:02:27,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You will agree.</font>

24
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:29,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll be going now.</font>

25
00:02:34,150 --> 00:02:34,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take care.</font>

26
00:02:55,440 --> 00:02:58,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 8]</font>

27
00:03:05,030 --> 00:03:06,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about this?</font>

28
00:03:06,310 --> 00:03:07,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why don't you all head back first,</font>

29
00:03:09,030 --> 00:03:09,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and we'll talk another day?</font>

30
00:03:15,910 --> 00:03:16,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

31
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:18,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you mean it?</font>

32
00:03:18,710 --> 00:03:19,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll come back again.</font>

33
00:03:31,750 --> 00:03:32,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tonight at ten o'clock.</font>

34
00:03:33,190 --> 00:03:33,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See you at the usual place.</font>

35
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:36,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay. Bye. Bye.</font>

36
00:03:39,470 --> 00:03:41,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The tax people asked about Aike.</font>

37
00:03:41,910 --> 00:03:43,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I said we were also victims,</font>

38
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:44,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and we knew nothing.</font>

39
00:03:45,590 --> 00:03:46,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Also,</font>

40
00:03:46,630 --> 00:03:47,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they originally planned</font>

41
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:49,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to audit all of Dongle's accounts.</font>

42
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:50,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I already took care of it.</font>

43
00:03:51,710 --> 00:03:52,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Manager</font>

44
00:03:52,310 --> 00:03:54,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou Haiyang already saw them off.</font>

45
00:03:55,030 --> 00:03:55,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry.</font>

46
00:03:57,710 --> 00:03:59,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's him again, auditing Dongle.</font>

47
00:04:03,030 --> 00:04:05,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tao, I didn't bring you much
from my hometown.</font>

48
00:04:06,910 --> 00:04:08,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You shouldn't have brought them.</font>

49
00:04:08,630 --> 00:04:09,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you for that.</font>

50
00:04:09,910 --> 00:04:11,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just some cured duck</font>

51
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and meat for the New Year.</font>

52
00:04:13,710 --> 00:04:14,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And some peanut oil.</font>

53
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:15,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

54
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:16,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come eat. Come eat.</font>

55
00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:17,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Okay.
- Thank you so much.</font>

56
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:18,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

57
00:04:18,870 --> 00:04:19,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sit, sit, sit.</font>

58
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:20,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry.</font>

59
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:22,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I should have come to see you
as soon as I got back.</font>

60
00:04:22,510 --> 00:04:23,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's fine, really.</font>

61
00:04:24,430 --> 00:04:24,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By the way,</font>

62
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:26,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is everything okay back home?</font>

63
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:27,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

64
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:29,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just that back home
I can't eat your Changfen.</font>

65
00:04:30,270 --> 00:04:31,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sometimes I really miss it.</font>

66
00:04:31,390 --> 00:04:32,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As long as you're in Chunjiang,</font>

67
00:04:33,190 --> 00:04:34,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll make you Changfen every day.</font>

68
00:04:35,510 --> 00:04:36,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By the way,</font>

69
00:04:36,070 --> 00:04:36,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how long are you staying?</font>

70
00:04:36,750 --> 00:04:37,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When are you leaving?</font>

71
00:04:38,160 --> 00:04:40,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This time I'm not leaving for now.</font>

72
00:04:40,310 --> 00:04:41,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I found a job in Chunjiang.</font>

73
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:44,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's great!</font>

74
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:46,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bring your wife over,</font>

75
00:04:46,190 --> 00:04:47,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you can settle down here, right?</font>

76
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:49,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What kind of Changfen do you want?</font>

77
00:04:49,160 --> 00:04:49,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll make it for you.</font>

78
00:04:49,750 --> 00:04:50,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about shrimp ones?</font>

79
00:04:50,830 --> 00:04:52,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mom, don't make it now.</font>

80
00:04:52,270 --> 00:04:53,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There are still so many dishes.</font>

81
00:04:54,510 --> 00:04:55,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's time for your mahjong game.</font>

82
00:04:56,120 --> 00:04:56,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, right.</font>

83
00:04:57,190 --> 00:04:58,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lots of regulars are waiting for me.</font>

84
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:01,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, Haiyang is here.</font>

85
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:02,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me toast you first.</font>

86
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:03,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

87
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:06,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good luck.</font>

88
00:05:07,070 --> 00:05:07,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good luck on everything.</font>

89
00:05:08,070 --> 00:05:09,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good health to you.</font>

90
00:05:10,510 --> 00:05:12,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These fish balls are really delicious.</font>

91
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:13,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have to go deal with them now.</font>

92
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:14,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait, wait.</font>

93
00:05:14,510 --> 00:05:15,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't stay out too late.</font>

94
00:05:15,190 --> 00:05:16,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry. I'll come back
once I've won enough.</font>

95
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:17,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't see me out. Sit, sit.</font>

96
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:18,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm off.</font>

97
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:19,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bye, Tao.</font>

98
00:05:19,630 --> 00:05:20,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bye-bye.</font>

99
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:21,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every night at this time,</font>

100
00:05:22,240 --> 00:05:23,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she goes to play mahjong.</font>

101
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:24,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She is in really good health.</font>

102
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:26,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ping'an, sorry.</font>

103
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:28,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I should have come</font>

104
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to find you as soon as I got back.</font>

105
00:05:32,430 --> 00:05:33,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you say</font>

106
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:35,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wouldn't end up with
a criminal record?</font>

107
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:37,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But in the end, I still got one.</font>

108
00:05:39,870 --> 00:05:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haiyang, here's the thing.</font>

109
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:42,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ping'an really made several</font>

110
00:05:42,430 --> 00:05:43,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">trips for your case,</font>

111
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:44,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and explained</font>

112
00:05:44,870 --> 00:05:45,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your situation to the higher-ups.</font>

113
00:05:46,430 --> 00:05:47,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This case...</font>

114
00:05:47,390 --> 00:05:48,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here's the thing.</font>

115
00:05:48,480 --> 00:05:49,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Residential surveillance</font>

116
00:05:49,510 --> 00:05:51,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">usually doesn't directly
leave a criminal record.</font>

117
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:52,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But a while ago,</font>

118
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:54,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the court ruled on your case.</font>

119
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:56,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The higher-ups made your case</font>

120
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:58,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a typical example of
a special crackdown.</font>

121
00:05:58,870 --> 00:06:00,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everything was handled strictly.</font>

122
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:00,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This...</font>

123
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:01,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just my bad luck.</font>

124
00:06:07,310 --> 00:06:08,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should know</font>

125
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:10,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my wife is in Hong Kong, China.</font>

126
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:11,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wanted to go see her.</font>

127
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:13,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They said I needed a travel permit.</font>

128
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:14,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Public Security Bureau</font>

129
00:06:14,830 --> 00:06:16,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">told the neighborhood committee
to issue me a certificate.</font>

130
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:18,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The neighborhood committee
said I have a criminal record.</font>

131
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:20,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They couldn't take that responsibility.</font>

132
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:21,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They didn't issue it.</font>

133
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:23,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I couldn't go there.</font>

134
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:26,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I was back in my hometown,</font>

135
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:27,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the subdistrict office kept telling me</font>

136
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:30,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that you two called to check on me,</font>

137
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:32,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">asking how I was doing.</font>

138
00:06:32,750 --> 00:06:34,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know you two went to a lot of places.</font>

139
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:38,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Brothers, I'll remember this kindness.</font>

140
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:40,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So why didn't you even tell us
that you were here?</font>

141
00:06:42,430 --> 00:06:44,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just felt I wasn't worthy.</font>

142
00:06:45,190 --> 00:06:47,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wanted to come back
and find a good job.</font>

143
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:49,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Earn some money to hold my head high.</font>

144
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:50,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I wouldn't embarrass my friends.</font>

145
00:06:51,240 --> 00:06:52,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once I got paid,</font>

146
00:06:52,750 --> 00:06:54,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd buy some decent clothes,</font>

147
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:55,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">bring some gifts,</font>

148
00:06:56,360 --> 00:06:57,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and then come find you.</font>

149
00:06:58,630 --> 00:07:00,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're talking like we're strangers.</font>

150
00:07:00,950 --> 00:07:02,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've been through life
and death together.</font>

151
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:03,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you think of us as your friends?</font>

152
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:05,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure, I do.</font>

153
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:07,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Drink that cola as a punishment.</font>

154
00:07:08,560 --> 00:07:08,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

155
00:07:10,630 --> 00:07:11,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Welcome back.</font>

156
00:07:14,430 --> 00:07:14,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Try this.</font>

157
00:07:14,920 --> 00:07:15,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's delicious.</font>

158
00:07:16,720 --> 00:07:17,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ouyang Xu said</font>

159
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:19,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he ran into you in Dongle today.</font>

160
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:20,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How come you went to Dongle?</font>

161
00:07:21,600 --> 00:07:22,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A friend introduced me.</font>

162
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:25,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Said it's a Chinese
Hong Kong-invested company.</font>

163
00:07:25,720 --> 00:07:27,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There are usually lots of customers
from Hong Kong, China.</font>

164
00:07:27,560 --> 00:07:28,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't go there, right?</font>

165
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:30,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So if one day I</font>

166
00:07:30,480 --> 00:07:31,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">become friends with
a customer from there,</font>

167
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:33,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when he goes back,</font>

168
00:07:33,390 --> 00:07:34,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll give him my wife's photo</font>

169
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:35,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and ask him to help me</font>

170
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:37,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">find out where my wife is.</font>

171
00:07:39,950 --> 00:07:40,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, right.</font>

172
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:45,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't you in Dongle?</font>

173
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:47,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you seen this person?</font>

174
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:14,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao.</font>

175
00:08:16,190 --> 00:08:17,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When did you come?</font>

176
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:18,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just came to check on you.</font>

177
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:20,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How's the place?</font>

178
00:08:20,390 --> 00:08:21,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Getting used to it?</font>

179
00:08:21,270 --> 00:08:22,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's great.</font>

180
00:08:22,800 --> 00:08:23,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you for arranging</font>

181
00:08:23,750 --> 00:08:24,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">such a nice place for me.</font>

182
00:08:25,630 --> 00:08:27,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you put a lock on it?</font>

183
00:08:29,120 --> 00:08:29,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I just...</font>

184
00:08:30,070 --> 00:08:31,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just have a habit of keeping a diary.</font>

185
00:08:32,750 --> 00:08:33,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me show you.</font>

186
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:35,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just for diaries and stuff.</font>

187
00:08:35,870 --> 00:08:37,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine. I won't look.</font>

188
00:08:39,870 --> 00:08:40,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See?</font>

189
00:08:40,750 --> 00:08:41,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sit.</font>

190
00:08:47,480 --> 00:08:48,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where did you go?</font>

191
00:08:48,870 --> 00:08:51,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I went out for a late-night meal
with two friends.</font>

192
00:08:51,030 --> 00:08:52,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We had hot pot.</font>

193
00:08:53,790 --> 00:08:55,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You made new friends that fast?</font>

194
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:58,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're old friends from when
I first came to Chunjiang.</font>

195
00:08:58,910 --> 00:09:00,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One is a police officer here,</font>

196
00:09:00,480 --> 00:09:01,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the other's from the tax bureau.</font>

197
00:09:10,120 --> 00:09:10,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry, Tianbao.</font>

198
00:09:10,910 --> 00:09:11,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I... I didn't know.</font>

199
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:14,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are we not supposed
to be friends with these people?</font>

200
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:14,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine.</font>

201
00:09:15,390 --> 00:09:16,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Making friends doesn't matter.</font>

202
00:09:17,390 --> 00:09:19,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have plenty of police friends
in Hong Kong, China.</font>

203
00:09:19,440 --> 00:09:21,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In our line of work,
we have all kinds of friends.</font>

204
00:09:22,510 --> 00:09:23,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sit.</font>

205
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:29,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So your friends can help out?</font>

206
00:09:36,750 --> 00:09:37,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're just good friends.</font>

207
00:09:38,550 --> 00:09:39,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll see how it goes.</font>

208
00:09:47,790 --> 00:09:49,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How's being a manager going?</font>

209
00:09:49,510 --> 00:09:50,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pretty good.</font>

210
00:09:51,630 --> 00:09:52,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, Tianbao.</font>

211
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never imagined before</font>

212
00:09:56,120 --> 00:09:58,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that I could wear
a suit and be a manager,</font>

213
00:09:58,670 --> 00:09:59,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">earning such a high salary.</font>

214
00:10:00,510 --> 00:10:03,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll gradually learn the work.</font>

215
00:10:03,750 --> 00:10:04,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sometimes when I</font>

216
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:05,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">ask Manager Wan something,</font>

217
00:10:05,630 --> 00:10:06,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he won't tell me.</font>

218
00:10:07,630 --> 00:10:09,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Manager Wan is Li Ahong's man.</font>

219
00:10:09,750 --> 00:10:11,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Ahong made a lot of money</font>

220
00:10:12,030 --> 00:10:12,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">smuggling goods through us.</font>

221
00:10:14,030 --> 00:10:16,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have to be careful with that woman.</font>

222
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:17,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao.</font>

223
00:10:18,270 --> 00:10:20,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So do you think I should do something?</font>

224
00:10:21,120 --> 00:10:24,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She really does make more money
than me in the mainland.</font>

225
00:10:24,390 --> 00:10:26,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I still need more time</font>

226
00:10:26,670 --> 00:10:27,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to see what she's up to.</font>

227
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:30,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From now on,
even if you lose a needle in Dongle,</font>

228
00:10:31,030 --> 00:10:32,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you have to come back and tell me.</font>

229
00:10:33,030 --> 00:10:34,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Understood. Don't worry.</font>

230
00:10:35,270 --> 00:10:35,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

231
00:10:37,030 --> 00:10:38,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Would you like something to eat?</font>

232
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:39,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need.</font>

233
00:10:44,750 --> 00:10:45,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, right.</font>

234
00:10:45,790 --> 00:10:47,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You had dinner</font>

235
00:10:48,750 --> 00:10:49,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with four people.</font>

236
00:10:52,030 --> 00:10:53,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One of them was Yan Ping'an's mother,</font>

237
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:55,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tao.</font>

238
00:10:58,150 --> 00:10:59,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry, Tianbao.</font>

239
00:10:59,550 --> 00:11:01,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I... I forgot to mention her.</font>

240
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:04,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You really are sincere.</font>

241
00:11:06,390 --> 00:11:07,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To the point of being scary.</font>

242
00:11:12,270 --> 00:11:12,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bye.</font>

243
00:11:34,600 --> 00:11:35,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello, ma'am.</font>

244
00:11:40,440 --> 00:11:41,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How old are you?</font>

245
00:11:42,200 --> 00:11:42,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">23.</font>

246
00:11:46,240 --> 00:11:47,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lin Ruyi.</font>

247
00:11:48,550 --> 00:11:49,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come down.</font>

248
00:11:59,630 --> 00:12:00,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

249
00:12:00,440 --> 00:12:01,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've got some nerve.</font>

250
00:12:01,750 --> 00:12:02,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You were just kidnapped</font>

251
00:12:03,030 --> 00:12:04,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you bring a stranger home.</font>

252
00:12:05,750 --> 00:12:06,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

253
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:06,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, no.</font>

254
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:07,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be scared.</font>

255
00:12:08,360 --> 00:12:09,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is my mom.</font>

256
00:12:09,750 --> 00:12:10,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every time I get kidnapped,</font>

257
00:12:10,790 --> 00:12:11,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she gets me back.</font>

258
00:12:14,150 --> 00:12:15,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me think.</font>

259
00:12:16,030 --> 00:12:17,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once when I was five,</font>

260
00:12:17,840 --> 00:12:19,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">once when I was twelve,</font>

261
00:12:19,080 --> 00:12:20,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and again a couple days ago.</font>

262
00:12:20,510 --> 00:12:21,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Things other families
never face in a lifetime</font>

263
00:12:22,320 --> 00:12:23,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is just a routine for me.</font>

264
00:12:24,550 --> 00:12:25,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, Mom,</font>

265
00:12:25,670 --> 00:12:27,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for giving me something
to brag about forever.</font>

266
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:45,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that enough?</font>

267
00:12:50,550 --> 00:12:51,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enough or not?</font>

268
00:12:52,030 --> 00:12:52,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, enough.</font>

269
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:54,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't come see my daughter again.</font>

270
00:12:57,510 --> 00:12:58,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lin Ruyi.</font>

271
00:12:58,910 --> 00:12:59,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at the boyfriend you found.</font>

272
00:13:01,150 --> 00:13:02,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For a few lousy bills,</font>

273
00:13:02,670 --> 00:13:03,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he'll never come see you again.</font>

274
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:07,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not her boyfriend.</font>

275
00:13:07,390 --> 00:13:08,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know her.</font>

276
00:13:09,120 --> 00:13:09,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then who are you?</font>

277
00:13:10,030 --> 00:13:11,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm from the bar.</font>

278
00:13:11,630 --> 00:13:12,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She drank and couldn't pay,</font>

279
00:13:13,030 --> 00:13:14,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so she told me to come here to get it.</font>

280
00:13:15,360 --> 00:13:16,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine, get lost.</font>

281
00:13:30,150 --> 00:13:30,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep messing around,</font>

282
00:13:33,550 --> 00:13:34,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you'll be the death of me.</font>

283
00:13:35,670 --> 00:13:36,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then no one will ransom you.</font>

284
00:13:39,960 --> 00:13:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is this fun?</font>

285
00:13:41,120 --> 00:13:42,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every other sentence is about money.</font>

286
00:13:42,720 --> 00:13:43,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you live without money?</font>

287
00:13:43,870 --> 00:13:44,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Without money, could you dress like this</font>

288
00:13:45,320 --> 00:13:46,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and live in such a big house?</font>

289
00:13:46,870 --> 00:13:48,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I hadn't protected
this family business,</font>

290
00:13:48,720 --> 00:13:50,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Lins would have
destroyed us long ago.</font>

291
00:13:52,910 --> 00:13:54,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You think I don't know the thing</font>

292
00:13:54,080 --> 00:13:55,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">between you and Li Guangzong?</font>

293
00:13:55,480 --> 00:13:56,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone in Chunjiang knows.</font>

294
00:13:57,270 --> 00:13:58,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Was that also for this family?</font>

295
00:13:59,910 --> 00:14:00,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you.</font>

296
00:14:01,480 --> 00:14:02,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Guangzong is dead.</font>

297
00:14:03,390 --> 00:14:04,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was so happy.</font>

298
00:14:04,790 --> 00:14:06,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I raced around Chunjiang for three days.</font>

299
00:14:06,390 --> 00:14:07,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was so happy...</font>

300
00:14:10,320 --> 00:14:10,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

301
00:14:11,720 --> 00:14:12,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You want to hit me?</font>

302
00:14:12,720 --> 00:14:14,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, hit me as hard as you can.</font>

303
00:14:14,240 --> 00:14:14,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hit me all you want.</font>

304
00:14:16,240 --> 00:14:17,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I die out there like my dad,</font>

305
00:14:17,630 --> 00:14:18,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'd be happy, right?</font>

306
00:14:18,630 --> 00:14:19,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'd be completely free, right?</font>

307
00:15:25,200 --> 00:15:25,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you here?</font>

308
00:15:28,910 --> 00:15:29,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where's the bathroom?</font>

309
00:15:29,870 --> 00:15:30,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Inside.</font>

310
00:15:30,790 --> 00:15:31,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm going to take a shower.</font>

311
00:15:32,240 --> 00:15:33,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait, you...</font>

312
00:15:33,080 --> 00:15:34,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you come to my house to shower?</font>

313
00:15:34,600 --> 00:15:35,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sleeping here.</font>

314
00:15:37,150 --> 00:15:38,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm staying here tonight.</font>

315
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:40,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't have any money.</font>

316
00:15:46,270 --> 00:15:47,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look, I can't help you much.</font>

317
00:15:48,240 --> 00:15:49,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take this and get a hotel room.</font>

318
00:15:54,720 --> 00:15:57,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mister, why is this money all wrinkled?</font>

319
00:15:58,240 --> 00:15:59,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's different from
what my mom gives me.</font>

320
00:16:02,080 --> 00:16:02,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about this?</font>

321
00:16:09,550 --> 00:16:11,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This money should be enough for a hotel.</font>

322
00:16:12,390 --> 00:16:13,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm staying here.</font>

323
00:16:14,790 --> 00:16:15,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That won't work.</font>

324
00:16:16,120 --> 00:16:17,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you stay here,</font>

325
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:18,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">then I'll have nowhere to stay.</font>

326
00:16:21,670 --> 00:16:22,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You stay at the hotel.</font>

327
00:16:30,790 --> 00:16:32,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help me change the sheets
and duvet cover.</font>

328
00:16:32,440 --> 00:16:32,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

329
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:33,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks.</font>

330
00:16:55,240 --> 00:17:08,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Amarilli, my sweetheart♪</font>

331
00:17:08,640 --> 00:17:16,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Please believe♪</font>

332
00:17:16,760 --> 00:17:26,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The sweet love in my heart♪</font>

333
00:17:26,640 --> 00:17:33,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let us never part♪</font>

334
00:17:33,960 --> 00:17:40,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kiss, kiss, kiss!</font>

335
00:17:44,120 --> 00:17:48,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Please believe♪</font>

336
00:17:48,320 --> 00:17:54,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪If you are afraid and hesitate♪</font>

337
00:17:54,440 --> 00:18:00,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪It will do you no good♪</font>

338
00:18:00,240 --> 00:18:05,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪What is engraved in my heart♪</font>

339
00:18:05,760 --> 00:18:14,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You can see♪</font>

340
00:18:15,600 --> 00:18:24,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Amarilli♪</font>

341
00:18:24,960 --> 00:18:34,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Amarilli♪</font>

342
00:18:34,640 --> 00:18:40,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Amarilli♪</font>

343
00:18:40,280 --> 00:18:47,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪And my love♪</font>

344
00:18:48,560 --> 00:18:52,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Chunjiang Tax Bureau]</font>

345
00:19:01,480 --> 00:19:02,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Still won't admit you're wrong?</font>

346
00:19:02,750 --> 00:19:03,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I did nothing wrong.</font>

347
00:19:03,640 --> 00:19:05,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine, fine.</font>

348
00:19:05,790 --> 00:19:06,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me get you another one.</font>

349
00:19:08,310 --> 00:19:10,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here, put this tax code on your head.</font>

350
00:19:10,960 --> 00:19:12,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take it, take it over.</font>

351
00:19:13,240 --> 00:19:15,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't believe I can't handle you.</font>

352
00:19:15,920 --> 00:19:17,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who told you to go to Dongle?</font>

353
00:19:17,510 --> 00:19:18,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Investigating Aike's smuggling</font>

354
00:19:18,960 --> 00:19:20,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is within my job scope.</font>

355
00:19:20,400 --> 00:19:21,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've talked until my lips are worn out,</font>

356
00:19:21,880 --> 00:19:22,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">telling you not</font>

357
00:19:22,880 --> 00:19:23,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to investigate.</font>

358
00:19:23,680 --> 00:19:24,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you just ignored me, right?</font>

359
00:19:25,270 --> 00:19:26,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you.</font>

360
00:19:26,750 --> 00:19:28,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't I tell you</font>

361
00:19:28,160 --> 00:19:29,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">not to go out with him?</font>

362
00:19:29,310 --> 00:19:30,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why don't you listen?</font>

363
00:19:30,310 --> 00:19:32,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Old man, I forced Yawen to go.</font>

364
00:19:32,590 --> 00:19:33,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It has nothing to do with her.</font>

365
00:19:33,270 --> 00:19:33,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shut up.</font>

366
00:19:34,200 --> 00:19:34,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief Zhang.</font>

367
00:19:35,240 --> 00:19:36,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I insisted on going with him.</font>

368
00:19:36,920 --> 00:19:37,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was wrong.</font>

369
00:19:37,680 --> 00:19:38,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief Zhang,</font>

370
00:19:38,640 --> 00:19:40,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I promise there won't be a second time.</font>

371
00:19:42,550 --> 00:19:43,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you?</font>

372
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:44,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I did nothing wrong.</font>

373
00:19:44,270 --> 00:19:45,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can still hold on.</font>

374
00:19:45,160 --> 00:19:45,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

375
00:19:45,960 --> 00:19:46,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go back to work.</font>

376
00:19:47,640 --> 00:19:48,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief Zhang.</font>

377
00:19:49,350 --> 00:19:49,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He...</font>

378
00:19:50,350 --> 00:19:51,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You want to stay with him?</font>

379
00:19:51,480 --> 00:19:52,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine, then do horse stance together.</font>

380
00:19:53,110 --> 00:19:53,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yawen, go.</font>

381
00:19:54,400 --> 00:19:55,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Goodbye, Chief Zhang.</font>

382
00:20:01,480 --> 00:20:03,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's see how long you can hold on.</font>

383
00:20:03,680 --> 00:20:05,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I did nothing wrong. I'm being truthful.</font>

384
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:06,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You taught me that.</font>

385
00:20:06,750 --> 00:20:08,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I also told you</font>

386
00:20:08,350 --> 00:20:10,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to analyze each situation specifically.</font>

387
00:20:10,350 --> 00:20:11,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you know what kind
of company Dongle is?</font>

388
00:20:12,110 --> 00:20:13,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's the apple of the city leaders' eye.</font>

389
00:20:13,920 --> 00:20:15,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They personally serve as</font>

390
00:20:15,400 --> 00:20:17,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">their liaison with
government departments.</font>

391
00:20:17,920 --> 00:20:19,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From bank loans,</font>

392
00:20:19,110 --> 00:20:19,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">land policies,</font>

393
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:21,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">tax and financial subsidies</font>

394
00:20:21,200 --> 00:20:22,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">down to municipal</font>

395
00:20:22,350 --> 00:20:23,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">roads, power, water, gas.</font>

396
00:20:23,400 --> 00:20:25,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Which one isn't strongly supported?</font>

397
00:20:25,880 --> 00:20:27,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When leaders from
other provinces visit Chunjiang,</font>

398
00:20:27,880 --> 00:20:30,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">their first stop is
always Dongle for a tour.</font>

399
00:20:30,720 --> 00:20:32,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So we can't even touch the tiger's rear?</font>

400
00:20:32,310 --> 00:20:32,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't believe it.</font>

401
00:20:33,160 --> 00:20:34,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You think you're the only one with guts?</font>

402
00:20:35,110 --> 00:20:35,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you know</font>

403
00:20:36,480 --> 00:20:37,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that as soon as you went to Dongle,</font>

404
00:20:37,880 --> 00:20:40,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director Zhao was called in
by the leaders to report?</font>

405
00:20:40,880 --> 00:20:41,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The leaders asked</font>

406
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:43,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what our bureau is trying to do.</font>

407
00:20:43,550 --> 00:20:44,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why do we interfere with</font>

408
00:20:44,510 --> 00:20:46,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the normal operations of a
Chinese Hong Kong-funded enterprise</font>

409
00:20:46,960 --> 00:20:48,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and damage Chunjiang's
investment environment?</font>

410
00:20:49,110 --> 00:20:49,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is our bureau</font>

411
00:20:49,720 --> 00:20:51,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">going to bear the responsibility?</font>

412
00:20:52,240 --> 00:20:53,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhang Haiyuan!</font>

413
00:20:53,960 --> 00:20:55,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now even you are saying this, right?</font>

414
00:20:56,110 --> 00:20:57,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So which is more important, the law</font>

415
00:20:57,350 --> 00:20:58,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or the leaders?</font>

416
00:20:58,440 --> 00:20:59,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Still talking back, huh?</font>

417
00:21:01,680 --> 00:21:03,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone is made of flesh and blood.</font>

418
00:21:03,030 --> 00:21:04,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one is made of steel.</font>

419
00:21:04,880 --> 00:21:06,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you think I don't want
to catch that guy</font>

420
00:21:06,640 --> 00:21:08,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who almost killed me with one stab?</font>

421
00:21:08,920 --> 00:21:10,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But what good would catching him do?</font>

422
00:21:10,720 --> 00:21:12,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's just a small fry.</font>

423
00:21:12,590 --> 00:21:13,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At most he stabbed me once.</font>

424
00:21:14,400 --> 00:21:16,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But if you touch their lifeline,</font>

425
00:21:16,510 --> 00:21:18,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they'll come at you
with deadly force, you know?</font>

426
00:21:24,160 --> 00:21:25,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yu, how have you been?</font>

427
00:21:25,310 --> 00:21:26,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Li, Mr. Yu, have some water.</font>

428
00:21:28,000 --> 00:21:28,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you heard recently</font>

429
00:21:28,920 --> 00:21:30,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about any new company going public?</font>

430
00:21:30,830 --> 00:21:32,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's been rumored that
Zheng's company would go public,</font>

431
00:21:32,510 --> 00:21:33,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but nothing has happened.</font>

432
00:21:33,640 --> 00:21:35,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm still waiting for
its new stock to list</font>

433
00:21:35,640 --> 00:21:37,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to make some quick money.</font>

434
00:21:37,270 --> 00:21:37,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Li.</font>

435
00:21:38,400 --> 00:21:40,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your old friend Mr. Zheng</font>

436
00:21:40,440 --> 00:21:41,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">came here</font>

437
00:21:41,510 --> 00:21:43,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to play golf last Wednesday
with a friend in securities.</font>

438
00:21:43,880 --> 00:21:44,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After playing,</font>

439
00:21:44,550 --> 00:21:45,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they even had a meal at our club.</font>

440
00:21:46,160 --> 00:21:47,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you talking about Zheng Guoming?</font>

441
00:21:47,720 --> 00:21:48,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, yes, yes.</font>

442
00:21:48,880 --> 00:21:50,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Looks like Zheng
is going public soon.</font>

443
00:21:51,070 --> 00:21:53,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's seize this opportunity
and get things arranged.</font>

444
00:21:53,510 --> 00:21:53,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

445
00:21:54,550 --> 00:21:55,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Young man, you're very thoughtful.</font>

446
00:21:56,240 --> 00:21:57,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I remember you haven't been here long.</font>

447
00:21:58,000 --> 00:21:58,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right, I just started.</font>

448
00:21:58,790 --> 00:21:59,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is your reward.</font>

449
00:21:59,790 --> 00:22:01,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, no, no. It's my duty.</font>

450
00:22:01,750 --> 00:22:02,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm in charge of business.</font>

451
00:22:02,880 --> 00:22:04,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In the future,
I'll need to rely on your help.</font>

452
00:22:04,680 --> 00:22:05,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Smart kid.</font>

453
00:22:05,960 --> 00:22:07,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For this news today,</font>

454
00:22:07,160 --> 00:22:08,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">renew Mr. Yu's and my</font>

455
00:22:08,350 --> 00:22:09,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">gold memberships for next year</font>

456
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:10,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and put it on my tab.</font>

457
00:22:11,160 --> 00:22:12,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, thank you.</font>

458
00:22:12,310 --> 00:22:13,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, thank you, Mr. Li.</font>

459
00:22:14,110 --> 00:22:14,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Manager Zhou.</font>

460
00:22:15,350 --> 00:22:16,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Someone is looking for you
in the lounge area.</font>

461
00:22:17,440 --> 00:22:18,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who's looking for me?</font>

462
00:22:18,440 --> 00:22:19,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll know when you go.</font>

463
00:22:36,000 --> 00:22:37,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's that young lady looking for you.</font>

464
00:22:37,480 --> 00:22:38,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou Haiyang.</font>

465
00:22:43,400 --> 00:22:44,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you recognize me?</font>

466
00:22:45,480 --> 00:22:46,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Lin, hello.</font>

467
00:22:46,510 --> 00:22:47,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What, do I not look good like this?</font>

468
00:22:49,590 --> 00:22:50,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This suits you very well.</font>

469
00:22:52,160 --> 00:22:53,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, then I'll dress
like this from now on.</font>

470
00:22:54,920 --> 00:22:55,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you want from me?</font>

471
00:22:56,880 --> 00:22:58,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Um, play golf with me.</font>

472
00:22:58,440 --> 00:22:59,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I'm working right now.</font>

473
00:23:00,590 --> 00:23:01,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What work?</font>

474
00:23:01,400 --> 00:23:02,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Which department are you in?</font>

475
00:23:02,640 --> 00:23:04,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm from the Membership Card Center's
Business Department.</font>

476
00:23:04,510 --> 00:23:05,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am a member,</font>

477
00:23:05,640 --> 00:23:07,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I have a business matter
to consult you about right now.</font>

478
00:23:07,720 --> 00:23:08,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Talk while you play.</font>

479
00:23:08,640 --> 00:23:09,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, play.</font>

480
00:23:09,680 --> 00:23:10,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know how to play.</font>

481
00:23:10,510 --> 00:23:11,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know you don't.</font>

482
00:23:11,830 --> 00:23:13,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, watch me.</font>

483
00:23:14,510 --> 00:23:16,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just hold this pile of balls like this.</font>

484
00:23:18,480 --> 00:23:19,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it?</font>

485
00:23:21,720 --> 00:23:23,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is this under our
Business Center's management?</font>

486
00:23:24,030 --> 00:23:24,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right, it is.</font>

487
00:23:25,350 --> 00:23:26,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, throw it like this.</font>

488
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:27,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

489
00:23:29,110 --> 00:23:29,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, good.</font>

490
00:23:30,110 --> 00:23:30,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One more.</font>

491
00:23:32,070 --> 00:23:33,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Great!</font>

492
00:23:34,250 --> 00:23:34,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

493
00:23:35,310 --> 00:23:35,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

494
00:23:35,790 --> 00:23:36,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This one's no good.</font>

495
00:23:36,240 --> 00:23:38,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You need to judge the distance well
when you throw from this position.</font>

496
00:23:45,790 --> 00:23:46,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

497
00:23:49,790 --> 00:23:50,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can you be so clumsy?</font>

498
00:23:51,000 --> 00:23:52,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've told you so many times</font>

499
00:23:52,400 --> 00:23:53,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you still can't do it.</font>

500
00:23:53,070 --> 00:23:53,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You just don't get it.</font>

501
00:23:53,720 --> 00:23:54,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you,</font>

502
00:23:54,790 --> 00:23:56,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">put your hand farther out.</font>

503
00:23:57,070 --> 00:23:57,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

504
00:23:58,000 --> 00:23:59,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Put your hand farther out. Right.</font>

505
00:23:59,920 --> 00:24:01,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You need to master this distance.</font>

506
00:24:01,750 --> 00:24:02,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Throw. See? Throw.</font>

507
00:24:03,000 --> 00:24:04,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't keep your hand so stiff.</font>

508
00:24:04,550 --> 00:24:05,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right, one more.</font>

509
00:24:05,640 --> 00:24:06,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One more ball.</font>

510
00:24:06,440 --> 00:24:07,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Manager Zhou is quite thoughtful.</font>

511
00:24:08,000 --> 00:24:08,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you go a little higher?</font>

512
00:24:09,000 --> 00:24:09,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right, just a little higher.</font>

513
00:24:09,750 --> 00:24:10,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right, right, like that.</font>

514
00:24:11,720 --> 00:24:12,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now you've finally learned it, right?</font>

515
00:24:14,440 --> 00:24:16,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right, great job.</font>

516
00:24:16,510 --> 00:24:17,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, come on.</font>

517
00:24:19,680 --> 00:24:20,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry up.</font>

518
00:24:21,720 --> 00:24:24,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good! One more.</font>

519
00:24:25,110 --> 00:24:26,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right, good job.</font>

520
00:24:26,640 --> 00:24:27,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Lin,</font>

521
00:24:27,880 --> 00:24:28,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really think</font>

522
00:24:28,550 --> 00:24:29,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this shouldn't be under our</font>

523
00:24:29,680 --> 00:24:31,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Membership Card Center's management.</font>

524
00:24:31,480 --> 00:24:32,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm responsible for issuing cards,</font>

525
00:24:32,680 --> 00:24:33,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">not for playing with you.</font>

526
00:24:33,720 --> 00:24:34,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I asked you to help me.</font>

527
00:24:34,510 --> 00:24:35,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't even throw a ball?</font>

528
00:24:35,550 --> 00:24:36,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is there a problem?</font>

529
00:24:36,350 --> 00:24:37,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone here comes to work</font>

530
00:24:37,720 --> 00:24:38,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to make a living.</font>

531
00:24:39,640 --> 00:24:40,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not that you can ask me to...</font>

532
00:24:40,480 --> 00:24:41,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop it. I don't want to play anymore.</font>

533
00:24:51,920 --> 00:24:52,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Manager Wan.</font>

534
00:24:52,790 --> 00:24:53,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong is looking for you.</font>

535
00:25:02,310 --> 00:25:03,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Manager Wan, where's Ahong?</font>

536
00:25:05,200 --> 00:25:05,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's waiting for you inside.</font>

537
00:25:41,070 --> 00:25:41,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

538
00:25:42,270 --> 00:25:43,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you want?</font>

539
00:25:51,000 --> 00:25:51,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let him go.</font>

540
00:25:57,070 --> 00:25:59,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What happened on the island that night?</font>

541
00:26:00,480 --> 00:26:01,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Police infiltrated the island</font>

542
00:26:02,960 --> 00:26:03,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and shut down the factory.</font>

543
00:26:04,750 --> 00:26:06,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could police get onto the island?</font>

544
00:26:07,880 --> 00:26:09,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It must have been Li Guangzong
who brought them up.</font>

545
00:26:09,310 --> 00:26:11,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why would Li Guangzong
bring police to the island?</font>

546
00:26:11,960 --> 00:26:13,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He wanted to take private jobs
to make money.</font>

547
00:26:15,720 --> 00:26:16,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did Li Guangzong die?</font>

548
00:26:18,400 --> 00:26:19,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He fell into the sea.</font>

549
00:26:19,640 --> 00:26:20,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then why are you fine?</font>

550
00:26:21,070 --> 00:26:22,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What could happen to me?</font>

551
00:26:22,400 --> 00:26:24,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm just a printing worker
in the factory.</font>

552
00:26:24,590 --> 00:26:25,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whatever the police asked me,</font>

553
00:26:25,640 --> 00:26:26,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just told them.</font>

554
00:26:26,960 --> 00:26:27,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So</font>

555
00:26:27,880 --> 00:26:30,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the police put me under
residential surveillance.</font>

556
00:26:30,790 --> 00:26:33,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Was Li Guangzong's death related to you?</font>

557
00:26:33,510 --> 00:26:34,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It had nothing to do with me.</font>

558
00:26:34,480 --> 00:26:35,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He fell into the sea by himself.</font>

559
00:26:36,830 --> 00:26:37,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dead men tell no tales.</font>

560
00:26:39,030 --> 00:26:39,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong,</font>

561
00:26:40,030 --> 00:26:41,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">everyone on the island knows</font>

562
00:26:41,920 --> 00:26:43,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the printing factory's
manager is Liu Bingren,</font>

563
00:26:44,310 --> 00:26:45,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the boss behind him is Li Guangzong.</font>

564
00:26:46,160 --> 00:26:47,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When the police questioned me,</font>

565
00:26:47,440 --> 00:26:49,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I said it was
Li Guangzong and Liu Bingren</font>

566
00:26:49,550 --> 00:26:50,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who brought me to the island.</font>

567
00:26:50,720 --> 00:26:51,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't mention you at all.</font>

568
00:26:52,310 --> 00:26:52,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why?</font>

569
00:26:55,160 --> 00:26:55,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because Ahong,</font>

570
00:26:57,440 --> 00:26:59,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you saved me and helped me.</font>

571
00:26:59,880 --> 00:27:01,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did you get connected with Tianbao?</font>

572
00:27:01,720 --> 00:27:03,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After I came back from my hometown,</font>

573
00:27:03,400 --> 00:27:05,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wanted to go to
Dongle Manor to find you</font>

574
00:27:05,440 --> 00:27:06,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and see if you could give me a chance.</font>

575
00:27:07,110 --> 00:27:08,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saw you were with Tianbao</font>

576
00:27:08,790 --> 00:27:09,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">several times at the gate,</font>

577
00:27:10,160 --> 00:27:11,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and then by accident,</font>

578
00:27:11,030 --> 00:27:11,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I got to know Tianbao.</font>

579
00:27:12,480 --> 00:27:13,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He knew I was looking for a job,</font>

580
00:27:13,830 --> 00:27:15,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so he introduced me to Dongle.</font>

581
00:27:15,720 --> 00:27:16,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That day at your home,</font>

582
00:27:17,070 --> 00:27:18,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I originally wanted to greet you,</font>

583
00:27:19,070 --> 00:27:20,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but you seemed to
pretend not to know me.</font>

584
00:27:21,350 --> 00:27:21,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't know</font>

585
00:27:22,000 --> 00:27:23,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">whether I should greet you or not.</font>

586
00:27:24,720 --> 00:27:25,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Work hard at Dongle.</font>

587
00:27:26,310 --> 00:27:27,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't care</font>

588
00:27:27,830 --> 00:27:28,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who introduced you here.</font>

589
00:27:28,720 --> 00:27:29,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But remember one thing.</font>

590
00:27:30,960 --> 00:27:32,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't set your sights
on my daughter, Lin Ruyi.</font>

591
00:27:34,400 --> 00:27:36,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, I'll kill you.</font>

592
00:27:39,200 --> 00:27:39,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it?</font>

593
00:27:43,200 --> 00:27:45,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Linhai Provincial Tax College]
For a business enterprise,</font>

594
00:27:45,590 --> 00:27:46,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if its land use does not meet</font>

595
00:27:46,750 --> 00:27:48,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the statutory tax exemption conditions,</font>

596
00:27:49,720 --> 00:27:52,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it shall pay land-related
taxes according to law.</font>

597
00:27:53,720 --> 00:27:55,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If we investigate Dongle</font>

598
00:27:55,310 --> 00:27:56,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from the land nature,</font>

599
00:27:56,960 --> 00:27:58,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">then the result will be nothing found.</font>

600
00:27:58,880 --> 00:28:00,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because Dongle's
land-related tax situation</font>

601
00:28:00,720 --> 00:28:01,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has no problems.</font>

602
00:28:02,000 --> 00:28:02,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, wait.</font>

603
00:28:03,030 --> 00:28:04,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing can be found?</font>

604
00:28:04,550 --> 00:28:05,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And there's no problem at all?</font>

605
00:28:06,680 --> 00:28:08,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then why investigate from this angle?</font>

606
00:28:09,070 --> 00:28:09,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's normal.</font>

607
00:28:10,270 --> 00:28:12,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you police just want</font>

608
00:28:12,110 --> 00:28:13,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the tax department to help
put up a smokescreen?</font>

609
00:28:16,270 --> 00:28:18,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Still, something's off.
What do you think?</font>

610
00:28:19,750 --> 00:28:21,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What difference does it make
if I talk or not?</font>

611
00:28:21,510 --> 00:28:22,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This matter now</font>

612
00:28:22,240 --> 00:28:23,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has nothing to do with me anymore.</font>

613
00:28:24,000 --> 00:28:24,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I went to investigate Dongle.</font>

614
00:28:25,000 --> 00:28:25,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My master wouldn't let me.</font>

615
00:28:25,830 --> 00:28:26,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He got angry with me.</font>

616
00:28:26,880 --> 00:28:28,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm on full-time study leave now.</font>

617
00:28:28,880 --> 00:28:30,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then why did he get angry</font>

618
00:28:30,240 --> 00:28:31,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and wouldn't let you investigate?</font>

619
00:28:34,400 --> 00:28:37,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ouyang, let me remind you.</font>

620
00:28:38,830 --> 00:28:40,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've been investigating
Dongle for so long.</font>

621
00:28:40,790 --> 00:28:42,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's definitely not groundless.</font>

622
00:28:42,680 --> 00:28:44,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Many tax-related crimes</font>

623
00:28:44,240 --> 00:28:45,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">may involve inside collusion.</font>

624
00:28:46,920 --> 00:28:48,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The most important thing now</font>

625
00:28:48,240 --> 00:28:49,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is not just whether you
want to investigate,</font>

626
00:28:50,590 --> 00:28:51,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but whether you dare to investigate.</font>

627
00:29:00,590 --> 00:29:01,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here it comes!</font>

628
00:29:03,310 --> 00:29:04,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The luxury Banana cruise ship.</font>

629
00:29:04,880 --> 00:29:05,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So luxurious!</font>

630
00:29:05,750 --> 00:29:06,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So luxurious!</font>

631
00:29:07,000 --> 00:29:07,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So exquisite!</font>

632
00:29:07,880 --> 00:29:08,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So exquisite!</font>

633
00:29:09,270 --> 00:29:10,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I won't hold back.</font>

634
00:29:10,030 --> 00:29:10,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eat.</font>

635
00:29:10,440 --> 00:29:11,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright.</font>

636
00:29:11,880 --> 00:29:12,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haven't had this in a long time.</font>

637
00:29:16,830 --> 00:29:17,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So delicious.</font>

638
00:29:19,510 --> 00:29:20,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here's the thing.</font>

639
00:29:21,510 --> 00:29:22,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't let you reward me for nothing.</font>

640
00:29:23,720 --> 00:29:24,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I found something.</font>

641
00:29:26,310 --> 00:29:28,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saw in Wang Zhou's work diary</font>

642
00:29:28,920 --> 00:29:30,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">something about Dongle's
land nature issue.</font>

643
00:29:32,550 --> 00:29:33,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have no idea.</font>

644
00:29:33,200 --> 00:29:34,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was almost caught by him.</font>

645
00:29:34,790 --> 00:29:36,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Zhou is completely obedient</font>

646
00:29:36,110 --> 00:29:36,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to Chief Zhang.</font>

647
00:29:38,310 --> 00:29:38,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you okay?</font>

648
00:29:39,070 --> 00:29:39,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm fine.</font>

649
00:29:44,510 --> 00:29:45,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I admire your appetite.</font>

650
00:29:47,270 --> 00:29:47,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you eaten?</font>

651
00:29:48,240 --> 00:29:48,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have.</font>

652
00:29:51,550 --> 00:29:52,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That scared me.</font>

653
00:29:52,590 --> 00:29:53,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Luckily, Jia Shijie helped.</font>

654
00:29:54,070 --> 00:29:55,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He said you owe him a big favor.</font>

655
00:29:56,440 --> 00:29:56,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it.</font>

656
00:29:58,350 --> 00:29:59,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I get promoted one day,</font>

657
00:29:59,920 --> 00:30:01,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take care of him, and you too.</font>

658
00:30:02,480 --> 00:30:03,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll definitely make it.</font>

659
00:30:03,270 --> 00:30:03,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll be waiting.</font>

660
00:30:05,510 --> 00:30:07,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I went to the Tax Collection
Department to see Mr. Zhao.</font>

661
00:30:08,200 --> 00:30:09,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He said you went to check</font>

662
00:30:09,680 --> 00:30:10,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dongle's tax collection
records last time.</font>

663
00:30:11,550 --> 00:30:13,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They thought there was a problem.</font>

664
00:30:14,000 --> 00:30:15,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The next day they</font>

665
00:30:15,720 --> 00:30:16,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">reported it to Chief Zhang.</font>

666
00:30:17,550 --> 00:30:19,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief Zhang must know
Dongle's tax amount</font>

667
00:30:19,590 --> 00:30:21,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">doesn't match their business scale.</font>

668
00:30:23,000 --> 00:30:23,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yawen.</font>

669
00:30:24,440 --> 00:30:25,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you sure</font>

670
00:30:26,880 --> 00:30:28,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they reported it to Zhang?</font>

671
00:30:28,830 --> 00:30:29,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sure.</font>

672
00:30:29,830 --> 00:30:31,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They reported the next day.</font>

673
00:31:07,480 --> 00:31:08,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou!</font>

674
00:31:09,720 --> 00:31:11,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you back so late?</font>

675
00:31:11,480 --> 00:31:13,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm starving.</font>

676
00:31:17,350 --> 00:31:18,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm talking to you. I'm hungry.</font>

677
00:31:20,750 --> 00:31:22,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm just an ordinary worker.</font>

678
00:31:23,030 --> 00:31:24,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop messing with me, okay?</font>

679
00:31:24,880 --> 00:31:26,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">An ordinary worker?</font>

680
00:31:26,590 --> 00:31:27,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Would an ordinary worker</font>

681
00:31:27,480 --> 00:31:28,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">go rescue</font>

682
00:31:28,270 --> 00:31:30,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">someone all by yourself?</font>

683
00:31:30,070 --> 00:31:31,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You almost lost your life.</font>

684
00:31:32,160 --> 00:31:32,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just work.</font>

685
00:31:34,030 --> 00:31:35,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I do whatever the boss says.</font>

686
00:31:40,030 --> 00:31:41,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If the boss told you to date me,</font>

687
00:31:41,030 --> 00:31:41,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would you do it?</font>

688
00:31:44,000 --> 00:31:45,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This boss is crazy.</font>

689
00:31:51,030 --> 00:31:51,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss.</font>

690
00:31:52,590 --> 00:31:53,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm almost 40.</font>

691
00:31:54,510 --> 00:31:55,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A few years older and
I could be your father.</font>

692
00:31:56,640 --> 00:31:57,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop joking around.</font>

693
00:31:58,830 --> 00:32:00,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And do you know I have a wife?</font>

694
00:32:00,920 --> 00:32:01,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came to Chunjiang to work</font>

695
00:32:02,000 --> 00:32:02,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just to earn money</font>

696
00:32:02,790 --> 00:32:04,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to go to Hong Kong, China
to find my wife.</font>

697
00:32:05,400 --> 00:32:06,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So please show some restraint.</font>

698
00:32:09,110 --> 00:32:10,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did my mom have someone beat you up?</font>

699
00:32:12,880 --> 00:32:13,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where did they hit you? Let me see.</font>

700
00:32:16,440 --> 00:32:17,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was just joking with you.</font>

701
00:32:18,110 --> 00:32:18,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know you're married.</font>

702
00:32:18,880 --> 00:32:19,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't really mess with you.</font>

703
00:32:26,240 --> 00:32:27,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your wife left you, right?</font>

704
00:32:31,480 --> 00:32:32,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou.</font>

705
00:32:35,440 --> 00:32:36,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou, Zhou, Zhou.</font>

706
00:34:04,790 --> 00:34:06,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm past hungry now.</font>

707
00:34:09,030 --> 00:34:09,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll try some.</font>

708
00:34:27,030 --> 00:34:27,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So good!</font>

709
00:34:42,480 --> 00:34:44,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A girl should eat with some manners.</font>

710
00:34:45,440 --> 00:34:47,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't had noodles
this good in a long time.</font>

711
00:34:47,670 --> 00:34:48,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just ordinary instant noodles.</font>

712
00:34:50,400 --> 00:34:51,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What did you put in here?</font>

713
00:34:52,110 --> 00:34:53,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't use
the seasoning packet inside.</font>

714
00:34:54,590 --> 00:34:56,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just added some oyster sauce
and light soy sauce.</font>

715
00:34:57,800 --> 00:34:59,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No wonder the taste is so familiar.</font>

716
00:34:59,590 --> 00:35:00,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My mom used to socialize a lot.</font>

717
00:35:01,630 --> 00:35:02,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After she had too much to drink,</font>

718
00:35:02,190 --> 00:35:03,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my dad would cook her
a bowl of noodles like this.</font>

719
00:35:03,920 --> 00:35:05,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I used to keep pestering him
to make it for me too.</font>

720
00:35:09,510 --> 00:35:10,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you making?</font>

721
00:35:10,840 --> 00:35:11,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I steamed some spare ribs.</font>

722
00:35:14,190 --> 00:35:14,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Done.</font>

723
00:35:15,030 --> 00:35:15,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wash your hands. Let's eat.</font>

724
00:35:28,440 --> 00:35:29,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me ask you something.</font>

725
00:35:31,630 --> 00:35:32,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides me,</font>

726
00:35:32,190 --> 00:35:33,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have you ever cooked for another woman</font>

727
00:35:33,150 --> 00:35:34,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">noodles like this?</font>

728
00:35:36,360 --> 00:35:37,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does my wife count?</font>

729
00:35:39,150 --> 00:35:39,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

730
00:35:49,150 --> 00:35:50,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xiaohong, I'm back.</font>

731
00:35:54,890 --> 00:35:57,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Once left in anger♪</font>

732
00:35:58,360 --> 00:36:00,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[I'm leaving. Don't look for me.
Jiang Xiaohong]</font>

733
00:36:00,960 --> 00:36:01,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You love your wife, don't you?</font>

734
00:36:04,360 --> 00:36:05,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that Hong Kong, China over there?</font>

735
00:36:07,150 --> 00:36:07,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

736
00:36:08,030 --> 00:36:09,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once I've earned enough money,</font>

737
00:36:09,670 --> 00:36:11,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go there and ask her</font>

738
00:36:11,320 --> 00:36:12,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why she left me.</font>

739
00:36:12,760 --> 00:36:13,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can money make someone come back?</font>

740
00:36:15,670 --> 00:36:18,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Money can make everyone
in the world turn back.</font>

741
00:36:20,550 --> 00:36:21,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You really don't understand women.</font>

742
00:36:24,510 --> 00:36:25,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Was your dad really good to you?</font>

743
00:36:26,710 --> 00:36:27,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I kind of forgot.</font>

744
00:36:28,440 --> 00:36:29,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He left when I was quite young.</font>

745
00:36:32,000 --> 00:36:33,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My third great-uncle loved me a lot.</font>

746
00:36:33,400 --> 00:36:34,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He spoiled me just like my dad did.</font>

747
00:36:35,360 --> 00:36:37,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every time Uncle Tianbao came to
the mainland on business,</font>

748
00:36:37,400 --> 00:36:39,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my third great-uncle would
have him bring me gifts.</font>

749
00:36:39,510 --> 00:36:40,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He brought me something
every single time.</font>

750
00:36:40,800 --> 00:36:42,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What about your mom?
How does she treat you?</font>

751
00:36:46,440 --> 00:36:48,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After my dad died, my mom</font>

752
00:36:50,550 --> 00:36:51,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">completely changed.</font>

753
00:36:52,400 --> 00:36:53,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She went crazy,</font>

754
00:36:53,880 --> 00:36:55,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">trying to take Dongle back,</font>

755
00:36:55,840 --> 00:36:57,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">afraid my third great-uncle
would take it away.</font>

756
00:36:58,480 --> 00:36:59,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Actually, I understand Ahong.</font>

757
00:37:01,190 --> 00:37:02,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe because you've never lacked money.</font>

758
00:37:03,110 --> 00:37:05,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My mom hasn't given me
much pocket money lately.</font>

759
00:37:05,150 --> 00:37:06,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I do have some cards.</font>

760
00:37:06,150 --> 00:37:07,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She cut them off.</font>

761
00:37:07,630 --> 00:37:11,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This, this is a gold card
for Dongle Manor.</font>

762
00:37:11,230 --> 00:37:11,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Annual fee is 500,000.</font>

763
00:37:12,190 --> 00:37:12,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All spending is free.</font>

764
00:37:13,280 --> 00:37:14,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can only get one in
Hong Kong, China or overseas.</font>

765
00:37:15,960 --> 00:37:16,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ever seen one?</font>

766
00:37:18,030 --> 00:37:18,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've heard of it.</font>

767
00:37:19,000 --> 00:37:19,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you just say</font>

768
00:37:19,760 --> 00:37:21,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">money can get anything done?</font>

769
00:37:23,510 --> 00:37:24,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have dinner with me.</font>

770
00:37:30,230 --> 00:37:31,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have to work.</font>

771
00:37:31,630 --> 00:37:32,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll use this card</font>

772
00:37:33,480 --> 00:37:34,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to buy your work, okay?</font>

773
00:37:42,270 --> 00:37:45,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Once left in anger♪</font>

774
00:37:46,410 --> 00:37:50,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Still missing your warm love♪</font>

775
00:37:53,230 --> 00:37:54,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My mom works like her life depends on it</font>

776
00:37:55,230 --> 00:37:56,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to earn this money.</font>

777
00:37:56,840 --> 00:37:57,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But she never asks</font>

778
00:37:57,840 --> 00:37:59,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what I actually want.</font>

779
00:38:04,110 --> 00:38:06,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Listening calmly♪</font>

780
00:38:08,150 --> 00:38:09,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou Haiyang.</font>

781
00:38:14,880 --> 00:38:16,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you hug me?</font>

782
00:38:16,430 --> 00:38:19,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Love is so brilliant♪</font>

783
00:38:20,760 --> 00:38:24,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can't you just have a meal with me?</font>

784
00:38:26,360 --> 00:38:28,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hug me.</font>

785
00:38:31,160 --> 00:38:36,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'm jealous of the ex♪</font>

786
00:38:36,230 --> 00:38:37,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll have dinner with you tomorrow.</font>

787
00:38:38,280 --> 00:38:38,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay!</font>

788
00:38:39,800 --> 00:38:40,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay!</font>

789
00:38:41,280 --> 00:38:43,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you running? It's just a hug.</font>

790
00:38:43,400 --> 00:38:45,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A hug. You promised me.</font>

791
00:38:46,670 --> 00:38:47,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

792
00:38:47,480 --> 00:38:48,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

793
00:38:48,190 --> 00:38:53,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Keeping calm to meet you♪</font>

794
00:38:55,030 --> 00:38:56,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But today, don't fight me for it.</font>

795
00:38:56,590 --> 00:38:57,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've already ordered the food.</font>

796
00:38:58,360 --> 00:38:59,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, have some tea.</font>

797
00:39:05,000 --> 00:39:05,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ping'an, this is yours.</font>

798
00:39:06,110 --> 00:39:06,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yours.</font>

799
00:39:07,550 --> 00:39:08,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This...</font>

800
00:39:08,150 --> 00:39:09,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leather shoes. They're not worth much.</font>

801
00:39:09,590 --> 00:39:10,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But they're genuine cowhide.</font>

802
00:39:10,920 --> 00:39:12,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The sizes are all correct.</font>

803
00:39:13,070 --> 00:39:14,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You shouldn't have.</font>

804
00:39:14,880 --> 00:39:15,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haiyang.</font>

805
00:39:15,960 --> 00:39:16,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

806
00:39:16,510 --> 00:39:17,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This.</font>

807
00:39:17,550 --> 00:39:18,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I went back to my hometown,</font>

808
00:39:19,190 --> 00:39:20,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you two gave me money.</font>

809
00:39:20,800 --> 00:39:21,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm returning it to you today.</font>

810
00:39:23,000 --> 00:39:24,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've made a fortune?</font>

811
00:39:25,840 --> 00:39:27,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bro, we can eat the meal,</font>

812
00:39:27,440 --> 00:39:28,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but we won't take the gifts.</font>

813
00:39:28,400 --> 00:39:30,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides, this money
wasn't meant to be repaid.</font>

814
00:39:30,480 --> 00:39:31,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you ask me,</font>

815
00:39:31,590 --> 00:39:32,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we can accept</font>

816
00:39:33,030 --> 00:39:33,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">these gifts.</font>

817
00:39:34,110 --> 00:39:35,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But take the money back.</font>

818
00:39:36,110 --> 00:39:36,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These gifts</font>

819
00:39:37,110 --> 00:39:38,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are just a small token from me.</font>

820
00:39:38,670 --> 00:39:39,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have to take them.</font>

821
00:39:40,000 --> 00:39:41,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This money was yours to begin with.</font>

822
00:39:41,760 --> 00:39:42,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So you should take it.</font>

823
00:39:43,360 --> 00:39:44,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't make any big fortune.</font>

824
00:39:44,880 --> 00:39:47,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just that my salary is a little</font>

825
00:39:48,630 --> 00:39:49,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">higher than I expected.</font>

826
00:39:52,880 --> 00:39:53,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take it.</font>

827
00:39:54,190 --> 00:39:55,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll come eat Changfen
at your place sometime.</font>

828
00:39:56,760 --> 00:39:57,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take it.</font>

829
00:40:02,110 --> 00:40:03,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, thank you.</font>

830
00:40:03,960 --> 00:40:05,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, all the dishes are served.</font>

831
00:40:05,960 --> 00:40:07,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know if they suit your taste.</font>

832
00:40:08,030 --> 00:40:08,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about this.</font>

833
00:40:08,840 --> 00:40:09,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me say something.</font>

834
00:40:10,150 --> 00:40:11,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here in Chunjiang,</font>

835
00:40:12,030 --> 00:40:12,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have no family.</font>

836
00:40:13,190 --> 00:40:15,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two are my
only family in Chunjiang.</font>

837
00:40:16,480 --> 00:40:18,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you for all your help and care.</font>

838
00:40:19,630 --> 00:40:20,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

839
00:40:20,630 --> 00:40:21,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's have a toast.</font>

840
00:40:21,630 --> 00:40:22,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be so polite.</font>

841
00:40:22,880 --> 00:40:23,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

842
00:40:24,760 --> 00:40:25,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll drink it up.</font>

843
00:40:25,960 --> 00:40:26,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Drink up, bro.</font>

844
00:40:30,840 --> 00:40:32,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, eat up.</font>

845
00:40:33,190 --> 00:40:33,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xu.</font>

846
00:40:33,760 --> 00:40:34,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, bro.</font>

847
00:40:35,280 --> 00:40:35,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ping'an.</font>

848
00:40:38,800 --> 00:40:39,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know if you like them.</font>

849
00:40:40,230 --> 00:40:40,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We do.</font>

850
00:40:41,400 --> 00:40:42,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eat up.</font>

851
00:40:42,920 --> 00:40:44,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I almost forgot something important.</font>

852
00:40:45,960 --> 00:40:46,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's for you.</font>

853
00:40:47,440 --> 00:40:48,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's for you.</font>

854
00:40:48,710 --> 00:40:49,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A Dongle experience voucher.</font>

855
00:40:49,920 --> 00:40:51,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Experience voucher]
Take this voucher</font>

856
00:40:51,070 --> 00:40:52,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you can play golf at my place.</font>

857
00:40:52,840 --> 00:40:54,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Free all day.</font>

858
00:40:54,800 --> 00:40:55,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you get a free drink too.</font>

859
00:40:57,440 --> 00:40:58,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After the free trial,</font>

860
00:40:58,280 --> 00:40:59,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we can't afford the membership anyway.</font>

861
00:40:59,670 --> 00:41:00,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's exactly why</font>

862
00:41:00,590 --> 00:41:01,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm giving this to you.</font>

863
00:41:01,840 --> 00:41:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But Xu,</font>

864
00:41:03,230 --> 00:41:05,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't wear your uniform when you come.</font>

865
00:41:05,150 --> 00:41:06,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wear something else.</font>

866
00:41:07,230 --> 00:41:08,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bro, did you know I
wanted to go to Dongle?</font>

867
00:41:09,320 --> 00:41:10,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You want to help me?</font>

868
00:41:16,000 --> 00:41:17,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you ask Manager Wan that day</font>

869
00:41:17,880 --> 00:41:19,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you wanted Dongle's member records?</font>

870
00:41:20,880 --> 00:41:22,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But our office policy is</font>

871
00:41:23,190 --> 00:41:25,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that member information
cannot be leaked.</font>

872
00:41:25,760 --> 00:41:27,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I lied. I'm at Dongle now.</font>

873
00:41:28,190 --> 00:41:29,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm in the marketing department.</font>

874
00:41:29,670 --> 00:41:31,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I happen to handle members.</font>

875
00:41:32,000 --> 00:41:32,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But the ones I handle</font>

876
00:41:33,150 --> 00:41:35,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are all members with
a 10,000 yuan entry fee.</font>

877
00:41:35,670 --> 00:41:36,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have their records.</font>

878
00:41:37,400 --> 00:41:38,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But you don't need to see them.
They're all clean.</font>

879
00:41:39,320 --> 00:41:40,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I guess what you want</font>

880
00:41:40,110 --> 00:41:41,460
